{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggin' Around is a\u00a0<strong>FROG-TABULOUS,\u00a0</strong>two player, co-op\u00a0only experience.\u00a0<strong>\ud83d\udc38</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two <strong>FROGS</strong>\u00a0on a magical quest.\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together and use your <strong>FROG POWERS\u00a0</strong>to progress and solve puzzles through this colorful fantasy world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embody a frog \ud83d\udc38</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl around, stretch your tongue,  croak and eat flies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.poster.avif?t=1770494372\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.webm?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.mp4?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate \ud83e\udd1d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with your partner to solve clever puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/9f9154b7893b5d6f382fbb4185a0b344.poster.avif?t=1770494372\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/9f9154b7893b5d6f382fbb4185a0b344.webm?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/9f9154b7893b5d6f382fbb4185a0b344.mp4?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a magical world \ud83d\udd2e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the wizard's workshop to the glowing sewers, travel through a variety of unusual locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find bouncy mushrooms, flying books and other intriguing objects on your path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/385a51f53c9f20bd3617c6cbda11b58e.poster.avif?t=1770494372\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/385a51f53c9f20bd3617c6cbda11b58e.webm?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/385a51f53c9f20bd3617c6cbda11b58e.mp4?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005900?t=1770494372","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/de28dae457f688c86bc5f4735e9f2dcfeca99989/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770494372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/6970f877e8c607e7e759f7c48929f6f63d9823c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770494372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/6970f877e8c607e7e759f7c48929f6f63d9823c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770494372","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Rem